#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:108
msgid ""
"<p>Select here the filter preset to use for photograph restoration:"
"<p><b>None</b>: Most common values. Puts settings to default."
"<p><b>Reduce Uniform Noise</b>: reduce small image artifacts like sensor noise."
"<p><b>Reduce JPEG Artefacts</b>: reduce large image artifacts like JPEG "
"compression mosaic."
"<p><b>Reduce Texturing</b>: reduce image artifacts like paper texture or Moire "
"patterns of a scanned image."
"<p>"
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:124
msgid "Smoothing"
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:126
msgid "Detail preservation:"
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:130
msgid ""
"<p>Preservation of details to set the sharpening level of the small features in "
"the target image. Higher values leave details sharp."
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:136
msgid "Anisotropy:"
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:140
msgid ""
"<p>Anisotropic (directional) modifier of the details. Keep it small for "
"Gaussian noise."
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:144
msgid "Smoothing:"
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:148
msgid ""
"<p>Total smoothing power: if Detail Factor sets the relative smoothing and "
"Gradient Factor the direction, Time Step sets the overall effect."
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:153
msgid "Regularity:"
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:157
msgid ""
"<p>This value controls the smoothing regularity of the target image. Do not use "
"an high value here, or the target image will be completely blurred."
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:163
msgid "Iterations:"
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:167
msgid "<p>Sets the number of times the filter is applied on the target image."
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:175
msgid "Advanced Settings"
msgstr "Gosodiadau Uwch"

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:177
msgid "Angular step:"
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:181
msgid ""
"<p>Set here the angular integration step in degrees in analogy to anisotropy."
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:185
msgid "Integral step:"
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:189
msgid "<p>Set here the spatial integral step. Stay below 1."
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_restoration.cpp:193
msgid "Gaussian:"
